    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>Finley</strong> and <strong>Orin</strong> as they reunite with <strong>Liriana</strong>, a childhood friend returning from her studies at the <strong>magic academy</strong> for the winter. But when mysterious events begin to develop in their village, the trio must embark on a quest to uncover the truth and restore balance to their world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Velana Adventures</strong> is a retro-inspired Tactical JRPG full of vibrant fantasy elements and rich lore drawn from our flagship title, <strong>War of Velana</strong>. In this first chapter, you'll be introduced to a rich world filled with memorable characters, vast landscapes, and dive into captivating stories that weave through the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/c23d9122ebfc2b5a430168d9d1888c93.poster.avif?t=1742753061\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/c23d9122ebfc2b5a430168d9d1888c93.webm?t=1742753061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/c23d9122ebfc2b5a430168d9d1888c93.mp4?t=1742753061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Tactical grid-based battles are fought on small battlefields</strong>, keeping combat focused and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Average story completion within 10 hours</strong>, with an Epilogue chapter offers many side quests, hidden secrets, and new battle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>A world infused with deep lore and history</strong>. Every object you encounter can be examined for deeper insight into Velana\u2019s storied past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Three playable characters</strong>, each with distinct classes and abilities, alongside a diverse cast of NPCs to meet and interact with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/377e244593160ce571fef73cdbdbffa7.poster.avif?t=1742753061\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/377e244593160ce571fef73cdbdbffa7.webm?t=1742753061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/377e244593160ce571fef73cdbdbffa7.mp4?t=1742753061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Breakdown:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Finley</strong>: A fierce <strong>Warrior</strong>, trained to draw enemies toward her and deliver physical attacks with her mighty axe. She also possesses healing magic, passed down from her mother, a devoted follower of the <strong>Velana Order</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Orin</strong>: A skilled <strong>Archer</strong> and the village hunter, his expertise in exploration and supportive abilities make him invaluable in keeping his allies strong and capable in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* <strong>Liriana</strong>: A trainee <strong>Mage</strong> from the academy, specializing in Ice and Lightning elemental spells. While not as physically capable as her friends, her powerful magic can strike enemies from a distance, making her just as formidable in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/ef1356bb9c9c36d11ccd0ea8c7e968ef.poster.avif?t=1742753061\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/ef1356bb9c9c36d11ccd0ea8c7e968ef.webm?t=1742753061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/ef1356bb9c9c36d11ccd0ea8c7e968ef.mp4?t=1742753061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
