/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/ef1356bb9c9c36d11ccd0ea8c7e968ef.poster.avif?t=1742753061\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/ef1356bb9c9c36d11ccd0ea8c7e968ef.webm?t=1742753061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003150/extras/ef1356bb9c9c36d11ccd0ea8c7e968ef.mp4?t=1742753061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
